  <text id="title" x="58" y="40" width="980" height="46" font="heading" size="30" color="ink" wrap="false">Notifications, handoffs, and supervisor follow-through</text>
  <text id="subtitle" x="58" y="86" width="1080" height="30" font="body" size="16" color="muted">The platform does not only store workflow status. It pushes the right reminders, actions, and summaries to the people responsible for moving work forward.</text>
  <shape id="shot-frame" type="rect" x="58" y="132" width="650" height="490" fill="paper" stroke="border" stroke-width="1" shadow="true"/>
  <image id="notifications-shot" src="https://private-us-east-1.manuscdn.com/sessionFile/i7Z8860JB409ZwkKDDtAu7/sandbox/slides_resource_ilxvirqgh4ifccy9plf8t-99b462a3-e2b-prod-us2_1784580276270_na1fn_L2hvbWUvdWJ1bnR1L2lkbHJfcHRzX21vYmlsZS9wcmVzZW50YXRpb25fYXNzZXRzL25vdGlmaWNhdGlvbnNfc2VlZGVkX3Yy.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1560,h_1560/format,webp&Expires=1786752000&_&Key-Pair-Id=K2QY5QTL8JSY6C&Signature=MEYCIQDebmka4PzYnDZo7V3w7zTMZHOeMRQSR1d3wwdbu3jnGwIhAIe~PcKRrVd9-LkLg5ZIusxg9P-rAwx9~LJgApJdvm5p" x="68" y="142" width="630" height="460" fit="cover"/>
  <text id="shot-caption" x="84" y="600" width="598" height="18" font="caption" size="12" color="muted" align="center">Real web screenshot: operational inbox with parcel-linked alerts, handoff reminders, digests, and inline reviewer actions</text>
  <shape id="intro-card" type="rect" x="740" y="142" width="482" height="104" fill="surface" stroke="border" stroke-width="1"/>
  <text id="intro-copy" x="764" y="166" width="434" height="60" font="body" size="18" color="ink" line-height="1.35">This inbox turns passive workflow records into active execution management. Reviewers, supervisors, and field teams can see what needs attention without navigating across multiple systems.</text>
  <shape id="alert-card" type="rect" x="740" y="270" width="482" height="96" fill="#F8FAFC" stroke="border" stroke-width="1"/>
  <text id="alert-title" x="764" y="290" width="434" height="22" font="body" size="18" color="ink"><p><strong>Handoff deadline alerts</strong></p></text>
  <text id="alert-copy" x="764" y="316" width="434" height="34" font="body" size="15" color="muted">Near-due and overdue cases are surfaced before escalation becomes invisible or unmanaged.</text>
  <shape id="digest-card" type="rect" x="740" y="388" width="482" height="96" fill="#F8FAFC" stroke="border" stroke-width="1"/>
  <text id="digest-title" x="764" y="408" width="434" height="22" font="body" size="18" color="ink"><p><strong>Supervisor digests</strong></p></text>
  <text id="digest-copy" x="764" y="434" width="434" height="34" font="body" size="15" color="muted">Backlog and overdue summaries can be delivered in-app and by email for management attention.</text>
  <shape id="action-card" type="rect" x="740" y="506" width="482" height="104" fill="#F8FAFC" stroke="border" stroke-width="1"/>
  <text id="action-title" x="764" y="526" width="434" height="22" font="body" size="18" color="ink"><p><strong>Inline action support</strong></p></text>
  <text id="action-copy" x="764" y="552" width="434" height="44" font="body" size="15" color="muted" line-height="1.3">Approvals, reads, dismissals, and related-task links are available directly from the alert stream, reducing delay between awareness and action.</text>
  <text id="footer" x="58" y="686" width="540" height="18" font="caption" size="12" color="muted" wrap="false">IDLR-PTS Platform • Nigeria stakeholder deck</text>
